Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nHealthy postmenopausal women with 50 or more moderate to severe hot flushes. \nWomen between 40 to 70 years of age. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nBody mass index (BMI) of 35 kg/m2 or more. \nSignificant metabolic and endocrine diseases. \nDiagnosis of cancer. \nUse of steroids or drugs that interfere with the metabolism of estrogen. \nUse of any systemic estrogen, progestin, or DHEA in the eight weeks prior to randomization. \nUse of alternative therapies or natural products to treat postmenopausal symptoms in the four weeks prior to randomization. \nPalpable fibroids or uterine prolapse: Grade 2 or 3. \nCigarette smoking       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nHealthy postmenopausal women [AND] with 50 or more moderate to severe hot flushes. \nWomen between 40 to 70 years of age. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nBody mass index (BMI) of 35 kg/m2 or more. \nSignificant metabolic [OR] and endocrine diseases. \nDiagnosis of cancer. \nUse of steroids [OR] or drugs that interfere with the metabolism of estrogen. \nUse of any systemic estrogen, [OR] progestin, [OR] or DHEA in the eight weeks prior to randomization. \nUse of alternative therapies [OR] or natural products to treat postmenopausal symptoms in the four weeks prior to randomization. \nPalpable fibroids [OR] or uterine prolapse: Grade 2 or 3. \nCigarette smoking       \n<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Healthy postmenopausal women [AND] with 50 or more moderate to severe hot flushes. 
Women between 40 to 70 years of age. 

Exclusion Criteria:
Body mass index (BMI) of 35 kg/m2 or more. 
Significant metabolic [OR] and endocrine diseases. 
Diagnosis of cancer. 
Use of steroids [OR] or drugs that interfere with the metabolism of estrogen. 
Use of any systemic estrogen, [OR] progestin, [OR] or DHEA in the eight weeks prior to randomization. 
Use of alternative therapies [OR] or natural products to treat postmenopausal symptoms in the four weeks prior to randomization. 
Palpable fibroids [OR] or uterine prolapse: Grade 2 or 3. 
Cigarette smoking       

