screening. \nHave used drugs for weight loss within 1 month of screening.       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nTreated with a stable dose of one of the following for at least 3 months prior to screening: * >=1000 mg/day immediate-release metformin; [OR] or metformin >=1000 mg/day [AND] and sulfonylurea; [OR] or sulfonylurea/ [OR] metformin combination therapy. \nHbA1c between 7.1% and 11.0%, inclusive. \nBody Mass Index (BMI) >21 kg/m^2 [AND] and <35 kg/m^2. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHave participated in this study previously, [OR] or any other study using exenatide [OR] or GLP-1 analogs. \nHave participated in an interventional, medical, [OR] surgical, [OR] or pharmaceutical study within 30 days of screening. \n Have characteristics contraindicating metformin [OR] or sulfonylurea use. \n Have been treated with exogenous insulin for more than 1 week within the 3 months prior to screening. \n Have used drugs for weight loss within 1 month of screening.<|eot_id|>']
