ring from psychotic illness according to DSM-IV (Axis 1)22, [OR] or with a history of CNS disease, a history of infection that might affect CNS (HIV, [OR] syphilis, [OR] cytomegalovirus, [OR] herpes), [OR] or a history of head injury [AND] with loss of consciousness,pregnant women.<|eot_id|>']
