Use of any investigational [OR] or [NOT] non-registered product (drug [OR] or vaccine) other than the study vaccine(s) within 30 days prior to the first vaccination, [OR] or planned use during the study period.
Any condition which, in the opinion of the investigator, [NOT] prevents the subject from participation in the study.
