ation [WHO] grade 3 or 4) \nLife expectancy ≥ 3 months \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nDiagnosis of brainstem glioma \nConcurrent administration of any other anti-tumor therapy \nPre-existing uncontrolled diarrhea<|eot_id|>']
