Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nThe study will include 40 post-deep peel women (exoderm), older than 18 years old, treated by the same dermatologist (dr. Landau). \nThe treatment group will receive 5 consecutive daily hyperbaric treatments, 1 hours long each, at 2 ATF, starting from day 7 to peel. Prior to treatment, each patient will be signed on informed consent and will have complete physical examination. \nThe control group will be matched by the following parameters: age, skin color and type, and indication for peeling, and will be picked up by the dermatologist. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPatients will be excluded if they have known middle ear disease, chronic lung disease or claustrophobia       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nThe study will include 40 post-deep peel women (exoderm), older than 18 years old, treated by the same dermatologist (dr. Landau). \nThe treatment group will receive 5 consecutive daily hyperbaric treatments, 1 hours long each, at 2 ATF, starting from day 7 to peel. Prior to treatment, each patient will be signed on informed consent and will have complete physical examination. \nThe control group will be matched by the following parameters: age, skin color [OR] and type, [AND] and indication for peeling, and will be picked up by the dermatologist. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPatients will be [NOT] excluded if they have known middle ear disease, chronic lung disease [OR] or claustrophobia<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
The study will include 40 post-deep peel women (exoderm), older than 18 years old, treated by the same dermatologist (dr. Landau). 
The treatment group will receive 5 consecutive daily hyperbaric treatments, 1 hours long each, at 2 ATF, starting from day 7 to peel. Prior to treatment, each patient will be signed on informed consent and will have complete physical examination. 
The control group will be matched by the following parameters: age, skin color [OR] and type, [AND] and indication for peeling, and will be picked up by the dermatologist. 

Exclusion Criteria:
Patients will be [NOT] excluded if they have known middle ear disease, chronic lung disease [OR] or claustrophobia
