ber dam \nUnderstand and sign consent form \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nASA 3+ \n [NOT] No current treatment plan at OHSU \nSeverely carious teeth resulting in [NOT] inability to isolate for procedure \nUnable to understand or sign consent form<|eot_id|>']
