Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nChildren between the ages of 4-18 with incomplete ASIA C or D spinal cord injuries at least 12 months before study enrolment \nNon-ambulatory or \'exercise only\' ambulators with or without assistive devices \nNormal motor and cognitive development up to time of injury \nMedical Stability \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nOther neuromuscular disease \nContraindication to weight bearing on lower extremities \nPressure sores where harness would be applied \nUncontrollable hypotension when upright \nLower limb contractures impeding range of motion necessary for ambulation \nPrior enrolment in a BWATT program \nUnable to commit to intervention for duration of protocol       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nChildren between the ages of 4-18 [AND] with incomplete ASIA C [OR] or D spinal cord injuries at least 12 months before study enrolment \n[NOT] Non-ambulatory [OR] or \'exercise only\' ambulators [AND] with or without assistive devices \nNormal motor [AND] and cognitive development up to time of injury \nMedical Stability \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nOther neuromuscular disease \nContraindication to weight bearing on lower extremities \nPressure sores where harness would be applied \nUncontrollable hypotension when upright \nLower limb contractures [NOT] impeding range of motion necessary for ambulation \nPrior enrolment in a BWATT program \n [NOT] Unable to commit to intervention for duration of protocol<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Children between the ages of 4-18 [AND] with incomplete ASIA C [OR] or D spinal cord injuries at least 12 months before study enrolment 
[NOT] Non-ambulatory [OR] or 'exercise only' ambulators [AND] with or without assistive devices 
Normal motor [AND] and cognitive development up to time of injury 
Medical Stability 

Exclusion Criteria:
Other neuromuscular disease 
Contraindication to weight bearing on lower extremities 
Pressure sores where harness would be applied 
Uncontrollable hypotension when upright 
Lower limb contractures [NOT] impeding range of motion necessary for ambulation 
Prior enrolment in a BWATT program 
 [NOT] Unable to commit to intervention for duration of protocol
