Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nAt least 18 years of age \nNo more than 20 wk of gestation \nGiven Ante-natal Cards of the Ghana Health Service \nCompleted the initial routine ante-natal examination at the clinics \nHIV negative or status unknown (as from the Ante-natal card) \nFree from chronic disease e.g. malignancy requiring frequent medical attention (as from the Ante-natal card) \nResiding in the Manya Krobo or Yilo Krobo district \nPrepared to sign an informed consent \nLiving in the area throughout the duration of the study \nAcceptance of home visitors \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nKnown asthmatic or history of allergy towards peanut or milk products \nConcurrent participation in another clinical trial \nSevere illness warranting hospital referral       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nAt least 18 years of age \nNo more than 20 wk of gestation \nGiven Ante-natal Cards of the Ghana Health Service \nCompleted the initial routine ante-natal examination at the clinics \nHIV negative [OR] or status unknown (as from the Ante-natal card) \n[NOT] Free from chronic disease e.g. malignancy requiring frequent medical attention (as from the Ante-natal card) \nResiding in the Manya Krobo [OR] or Yilo Krobo district \nPrepared to sign an informed consent \nLiving in the area throughout the duration of the study \nAcceptance of home visitors \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nKnown asthmatic [OR] or history of allergy towards peanut [OR] or milk products \nConcurrent participation in another clinical trial \nSevere illness warranting hospital referral       \n<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
At least 18 years of age 
No more than 20 wk of gestation 
Given Ante-natal Cards of the Ghana Health Service 
Completed the initial routine ante-natal examination at the clinics 
HIV negative [OR] or status unknown (as from the Ante-natal card) 
[NOT] Free from chronic disease e.g. malignancy requiring frequent medical attention (as from the Ante-natal card) 
Residing in the Manya Krobo [OR] or Yilo Krobo district 
Prepared to sign an informed consent 
Living in the area throughout the duration of the study 
Acceptance of home visitors 

Exclusion Criteria:
Known asthmatic [OR] or history of allergy towards peanut [OR] or milk products 
Concurrent participation in another clinical trial 
Severe illness warranting hospital referral       

