nging from a letter score of 0 to 70 on the Early Treatment Diabetic Retinopathy Study chart \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nchoroidal neovascularization caused by other eye diseases \nocular surgery within the past 3 mouths \nhistory of uveitis \nintraocular pressure higher than 25 mmHg, [OR] or glaucoma \nhistory of systemic [OR] or ocular thromboembolic events.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
choroidal neovascularization caused by age-related macula degeneration 
[NOT] no previous treatment 
a follow-up at least 12 months 
a baseline visual acuity ranging from a letter score of 0 to 70 on the Early Treatment Diabetic Retinopathy Study chart 

Exclusion Criteria:
choroidal neovascularization caused by other eye diseases 
ocular surgery within the past 3 mouths 
history of uveitis 
intraocular pressure higher than 25 mmHg, [OR] or glaucoma 
history of systemic [OR] or ocular thromboembolic events.
