:\nmajor systemic disease\nPregnant woman [AND] with infection of human immunodeficiency virus [OR] or hepatitis C virus\nPregnant woman [AND] is receiving any drug with antiviral activity [OR] or any form of drug therapy for hepatitis B virus\nPregnant woman [AND] whose ultrasonographic examination reveals congenital anomaly of the fetus\nPregnant woman [AND] whose amniocentesis reveals any genetic abnormality<|eot_id|>']
