t\nPossible pregnancy (confirmed by urine test)\nWomen [AND] who are breastfeeding\nSevere claustrophobia\n [NOT] Inability to lie flat for 20-30 minutes (the anticipated amount of time to complete the MRI procedure)\nIndividuals with cochlear implants\nIndividuals with non-MRI compatible aneurysm clips\nPotential contraindications to regadenoson use due to:\nContraindication to administration of Gadolinium (Gd) based contrast agents (GBCA):<|eot_id|>']
