prior 5 years\nhormone ablation for 2 months prior to treatment or during treatment\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nhistologically proven prostate adenocarcinoma within 1 year of enrollment\nLow risk: Gleason <or=6 [AND] & PSA <or=10 [AND] & Clinical Stage T1b-T2a,Nx [OR] or N0, Mx [OR] or M0\nIntermediate risk:Gleason <or=6 [AND] & PSA<or=10 [AND] & Clinical Stage T2b [OR] OR Gleason=7 [AND] & PSA<or=10 [AND] & Clinical Stage T1b-T2b [OR] OR Gleason <or=6 [AND] & PSA > 10 [AND] & < or =20 [AND] & Clinical Stage T1b- T2b, Nx [OR] or NO, Mx [OR] or M0\nECOG Performance Status 0-1\n[NOT] No prior prostate radiation [OR] or other definitive therapy\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nimplanted hardware [OR] or other material that would [NOT] prohibit treatment planning [OR] or delivery\nchemotherapy [OR] for a malignancy within the previous 5 years\nhistory of an invasive malignancy (other than this prostate cancer, [OR] or basal [OR] or squamous skin cancers) within prior 5 years\nhormone ablation for 2 months prior to treatment [OR] or during treatment<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
histologically proven prostate adenocarcinoma within 1 year of enrollment
Low risk: Gleason <or=6 [AND] & PSA <or=10 [AND] & Clinical Stage T1b-T2a,Nx [OR] or N0, Mx [OR] or M0
Intermediate risk:Gleason <or=6 [AND] & PSA<or=10 [AND] & Clinical Stage T2b [OR] OR Gleason=7 [AND] & PSA<or=10 [AND] & Clinical Stage T1b-T2b [OR] OR Gleason <or=6 [AND] & PSA > 10 [AND] & < or =20 [AND] & Clinical Stage T1b- T2b, Nx [OR] or NO, Mx [OR] or M0
