y drug [OR] or related compounds [OR] and additives\nHistory of alcoholism, [OR] drug abuse, [OR] psychiatric, [OR] psychological [OR] or other emotional problems that are likely to invalidate informed consent\nSleep apnoea\nChronic obstructive pulmonary disease\nBMI = 35 [OR] or weight < 50 kg\nSpO2 < 90 %\nConcomitant drug therapy known to cause significant enzyme induction [OR] or inhibition of CYP 3A4.\nPregnancy [OR] or nursing.<|eot_id|>']
