Contraindication of CT Known allergy to iodinated contrast media [OR] or history of contrast-induced nephropathy Decreased renal function: elevated serum creatinine(>1.5mg/dl) Contraindication to beta-blockers Severe arrhythmia: arterial fibrillation [OR] or uncontrolled tachyarrhythmia, [OR] or advanced atrioventricular block (second or third degree heart block)
