 6\n [NOT] no contra-indication for medical induction of labor\n [NOT] no clinical signs of infection\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nfetal anomalies\ncontra-indications for medical induction of labor\nplacental pathologies\nSt.p. surgery [AND] with opening the uterine cavity (incl. caesarean section)\nPROM\nmultiple gestations\n< 37-0 weeks of gestation\nSt.p. cervical tear<|eot_id|>']
