\n History of prior stroke\n Currently prescribed medication with anti-epileptic activity (keppra, [OR] dilantin, [OR] tegretol, [OR] lamictal, [OR] topamax, etc.)\nBrain tumor\nPregnant [OR] or nursing woman\n Known levetiracetam allergy<|eot_id|>']
