ual contact with partner\nBe willing to comply with study procedures\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nVolunteers must [NOT] not have been vaccinated against HPV-Gardasil-9 (both partners)\nAny history of cervical, [OR] penile, [OR] oral [OR] or anal cancers\nBeing pregnant [OR] or plan on immediately becoming pregnant<|eot_id|>']
