Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nall adult patients with a nasal or facial skin/soft tissue defect requiring reconstruction limited to or including a full-thickness skin graft\n\nExclusion Criteria:\ncurrent or recent (within one week of surgery) systemic antibiotic use, intolerance to both clindamycin and cephalexin, discovery of a persistent cutaneous malignancy at the site of the defect following the reconstructive procedure and previous reconstruction at the site of the skin/soft-tissue defect.\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nall adult patients with a nasal [OR] or facial skin/ [OR] soft tissue defect requiring reconstruction limited to or including a full-thickness skin graft\n\nExclusion Criteria:\ncurrent [OR] or recent (within one week of surgery) systemic antibiotic use, intolerance to both clindamycin [OR] and cephalexin, discovery of a persistent cutaneous malignancy at the site of the defect following the reconstructive procedure and previous reconstruction at the site of the skin/ [OR] soft-tissue defect.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
all adult patients with a nasal [OR] or facial skin/ [OR] soft tissue defect requiring reconstruction limited to or including a full-thickness skin graft

Exclusion Criteria:
current [OR] or recent (within one week of surgery) systemic antibiotic use, intolerance to both clindamycin [OR] and cephalexin, discovery of a persistent cutaneous malignancy at the site of the defect following the reconstructive procedure and previous reconstruction at the site of the skin/ [OR] soft-tissue defect.
