e\nAUDIT score of > or equal to 5, < or equal to 26\nAged 18 years or older\nWilling to attend study sessions and follow other study protocol\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nUse of smoking cessation medications [OR] or interventions in last 30 days\nUnstable medical illness that requires immediate medical care\nAUDIT score of < 5 [OR] or > 26\nPregnancy [OR] or other Nicotine Replacement Therapy (NRT) contraindications\nCurrent history [OR] or in past 6 months of psychotic disorder [OR] or major depressive disorders that is [NOT] not stable on treatment for past 3 months\nCognitive impairment<|eot_id|>']
