ia:\nInmate of a correctional facility (i.e. prisoners).\nPregnancy\nDocumented [OR] or suspected family [OR] or personal history of malignant hyperthermia.\nPatient [NOT] unable to receive either propofol [OR] or isoflurane due to allergy [OR] or other specific contraindication.<|eot_id|>']
