ND] with percutaneous pinning under general anesthesia\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPulseless extremity\nCompromised neurologic status on exam (specifically assessment of radial, [OR] ulnar, [OR] and median nerve)\nKnown allergy to local anesthetics (7) [NOT] Not scheduled for closed reduction [AND] with percutaneous pinning under general anesthesia\nBleeding diathesis\nAmerican Society of Anesthesiologist (ASA) status 4 or higher.\nSleep apnea by polysomnography<|eot_id|>']
