File: NCT02186600 

Das File: /work/eauten2s/ec_criteria_struct/chia/input/chia_text_full/NCT02186600.txt wurde erfolgreich geladen.
Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nWomen who are in their first 5 years of menopause \nHave a T score between -1 and -2.49 at the femoral neck, total hip, or L1-L4 spine \nBe 19 years of age or older \nHave their health care provider\'s permission to enroll in the study. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHave osteoporosis \nHave a 10 yr probability of hip fracture >3% or major fracture >20% based on results of the FRAX tool \nCurrently take bisphosphonates, estrogen replacement therapy, glucocorticosteroids, or other drugs affecting bone \nCurrently participate in a resistance training or high impact weight bearing exercise program two or more times weekly \nWeigh >300 lbs \nHave abnormal results for the following laboratory tests: serum 25(OH)D; serum creatinine; serum calcium; PTH; TSH \nHave Paget\'s disease, heart disease, uncontrolled hypertension, renal disease, or other concomitant conditions that prohibit participation in exercises, risedronate therapy, or use of CaD supplements.       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nWomen [AND] who are in their first 5 years of menopause \nHave a T score between -1 and -2.49 at the femoral neck, [OR] total hip, [OR] or L1-L4 spine \nBe 19 years of age or older \nHave their health care provider\'s permission to enroll in the study. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHave osteoporosis \nHave a 10 yr probability of hip fracture >3% [OR] or major fracture >20% based on results of the FRAX tool \nCurrently take bisphosphonates, [OR] estrogen replacement therapy, [OR] glucocorticosteroids, [OR] or other drugs affecting bone \n Currently participate in a resistance training [OR] or high impact weight bearing exercise program two or more times weekly \nWeigh >300 lbs \nHave abnormal results for the following laboratory tests: serum 25(OH)D; serum creatinine; serum calcium; [OR] PTH; [OR] TSH \nHave Paget\'s disease, [OR] heart disease, uncontrolled hypertension, [OR] renal disease, [OR] or other concomitant conditions that [NOT] prohibit participation in exercises, [OR] risedronate therapy, [OR] or use of CaD supplements.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Women [AND] who are in their first 5 years of menopause 
Have a T score between -1 and -2.49 at the femoral neck, [OR] total hip, [OR] or L1-L4 spine 
Be 19 years of age or older 
Have their health care provider's permission to enroll in the study. 

Exclusion Criteria:
Have osteoporosis 
Have a 10 yr probability of hip fracture >3% [OR] or major fracture >20% based on results of the FRAX tool 
Currently take bisphosphonates, [OR] estrogen replacement therapy, [OR] glucocorticosteroids, [OR] or other drugs affecting bone 
 Currently participate in a resistance training [OR] or high impact weight bearing exercise program two or more times weekly 
Weigh >300 lbs 
Have abnormal results for the following laboratory tests: serum 25(OH)D; serum creatinine; serum calcium; [OR] PTH; [OR] TSH 
Have Paget's disease, [OR] heart disease, uncontrolled hypertension, [OR] renal disease, [OR] or other concomitant conditions that [NOT] prohibit participation in exercises, [OR] risedronate therapy, [OR] or use of CaD supplements.
