 at inclusion\n [NOT] No previous iron supplementation\n [NOT] No previous blood transfusion\nInformed consent given\n\nExclusion Criteria:\npreterm delivery (<37 weeks of gestation)\nbirth weight < 2500 g\nmultiple pregnancy\nmajor illness [OR] or congenital anomaly\n being <50% breastfed at the time of inclusion\nfood allergy\nanaemia (Hb <105 g/L [10.5 g/dL]) at inclusion, lack of informed consent<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Term singleton infants (>37 weeks gestational age)
Birth weight > 2500g
Healthy at inclusion
Breastfed exclusively [OR] or predominantly (>50% meals) at inclusion
 [NOT] No previous iron supplementation
 [NOT] No previous blood transfusion
Informed consent given

Exclusion Criteria:
preterm delivery (<37 weeks of gestation)
birth weight < 2500 g
multiple pregnancy
major illness [OR] or congenital anomaly
 being <50% breastfed at the time of inclusion
food allergy
anaemia (Hb <105 g/L [10.5 g/dL]) at inclusion, lack of informed consent
