Patients who meet 1987 ACR criteria for SLE [AND] with 1996 modifications
SLEDAI >/= 6 at screening visit
Positive ANA [OR] OR anti-dsDNA within one year of screening
In the opinion of the investigator there is intent to treat with a biologic (e.g. patient failed standard of care treatment) however there is [NOT] no organ threatening disease

Exclusion Criteria:
NA
