t the following definition for adhesive capsulitis as defined by the American Academy of Orthopedic Surgeons: Self-limiting condition resulting from any inflammatory process about the shoulder in which capsular scar tissue is produced, resulting in pain [OR] and limited range of motion; also called frozen shoulder\nMust be amenable to randomization into either cohort\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n[NOT] Non-English speaking patients\nPregnant women (women [AND] of childbearing potential will be advised to undergo regular pregnancy testing)\nPatients who had previously undergone operative therapy for the condition<|eot_id|>']
