 document\n\nExclusion Criteria:\ndon\'t have Diabetes [OR] and abnormal metabolism of sugar\n [NOT] not noticed as bipolar disorder\nhave an organic brain disease\npregnant [OR] or breastfeeding women\n [NOT] don\'t have heart disease\nhave actively suicidal thought(Suicidal ideation score of MADRS is 6)\nwho are judged by the investigator to should be [NOT] excluded from the study<|eot_id|>']
