meres of fairly equal size [AND] with few to [NOT] no cytoplasmic fragments).\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPCOS [OR] or polycystic ovary on ultrasound scan.\nModerate [OR] or severe endometriosis.\nHydrosalpinx.\nUterine abnormalities [OR] or myoma.\nPrevious uterine surgery.<|eot_id|>']
