\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n [NOT] No known history of seizure activity.\nPregnant [OR] or breastfeeding.\nRenal dysfunction (CrCl < 30ml/min).\n Beck\'s Depression Inventory (BDI) =14\nAllergy to levetiracetam.<|eot_id|>']
