asodilatation (SkARV) test;\n Known allergies to midodrine hydrochloride;\n PMH of diagnosed heart, [OR] kidney, [OR] peripheral vascular, [OR] or cerebral vascular disease, [OR] or diabetes mellitus;\n Hypertension (BP>140/90 mmHg);\n [NOT] Untreated thyroid disease;\n Acute illness [OR] or infection;\n Current smoker;\n Pregnancy.<|eot_id|>']
