Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nGood general health\nOlder than the age of legal consent (i.e. 18 years old)\nSonographic diagnosis of ovarian endometrioma with diameter at least 4cm on 2 separate scans at least 6 weeks apart\nNo contraindication to use of progesterone or combined oral contraceptive pills\nNot attempting to conceive either at the time of study entry or for at least 2 years after surgery\nWilling and able to participate after the study has been explained\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nOperative findings not suggestive of endometriotic cyst\nContraindications to progestogens or oral contraceptive pills\nUnwillingness to tolerate menstrual irregularity\nPlanning pregnancy within 2 years of study\nCannot understand English, Cantonese or Putonghua\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nGood general health\nOlder than the age of legal consent (i.e. 18 years old)\nSonographic diagnosis of ovarian endometrioma [AND] with diameter at least 4cm on 2 separate scans at least 6 weeks apart\n [NOT] No contraindication to use of progesterone [OR] or combined oral contraceptive pills\n [NOT] Not attempting to conceive either at the time of study entry [OR] or for at least 2 years after surgery\nWilling and able to participate after the study has been explained\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nOperative findings [NOT] not suggestive of endometriotic cyst\nContraindications to progestogens [OR] or oral contraceptive pills\n Unwillingness to tolerate menstrual irregularity\nPlanning pregnancy within 2 years of study\nCannot understand English, Cantonese [OR] or Putonghua<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Good general health
Older than the age of legal consent (i.e. 18 years old)
Sonographic diagnosis of ovarian endometrioma [AND] with diameter at least 4cm on 2 separate scans at least 6 weeks apart
 [NOT] No contraindication to use of progesterone [OR] or combined oral contraceptive pills
 [NOT] Not attempting to conceive either at the time of study entry [OR] or for at least 2 years after surgery
Willing and able to participate after the study has been explained

Exclusion Criteria:
Operative findings [NOT] not suggestive of endometriotic cyst
Contraindications to progestogens [OR] or oral contraceptive pills
 Unwillingness to tolerate menstrual irregularity
Planning pregnancy within 2 years of study
Cannot understand English, Cantonese [OR] or Putonghua
