Subjects admitted to the hospital with acute [OR] or chronic medical illnesses [OR] or for elective [OR] and emergency surgical illness [OR] or trauma
Known history of Type 2 diabetes mellitus for >3 months
Treated with either diet alone, any combination of oral antidiabetic agents, [OR] non-insulin injectables [OR] or insulin therapy
Blood glucose levels between >140 mg [AND] and <400 mg/dL [NOT] without laboratory evidence of diabetic ketoacidosis

Exclusion Criteria:
NA
