0 mg/dL The 2nd group will have and LDL=/>130 mg/dL [AND] and Triglycerides =/>150 mg/dL [AND] but less than 400 mg/dL.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nLess than 30 yrs of age [OR] or > 65 yrs of age\nAny significant co-morbidities, such as active heart, [OR] kidney, [OR] or liver diseases, accelerated [OR] or malignant hypertension, [OR] heart failure, severe anemia.<|eot_id|>']
