ae, [OR] flexors of fingers, [OR] of wrist [OR] and of elbow\nA free consent\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPrevious antispastic drugs\nContraindication for baclofen [OR] or toxin\nAntecedent of epileptic seizure\nPsychiatric antecedent<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
First single stroke ischaemic [OR] or haemorrhagic responsible of an hemiplegia
Stoke since less than 2 month
A sufficient understood
A spasticity : a Tardieu score upper or equal to 2 on at least one of the following muscle-triceps surae, [OR] flexors of fingers, [OR] of wrist [OR] and of elbow
A free consent

Exclusion Criteria:
Previous antispastic drugs
Contraindication for baclofen [OR] or toxin
Antecedent of epileptic seizure
Psychiatric antecedent
