se:\nInclusion Criteria:\nAge=18 years [AND] and =80 years;\nPatients with [NOT] non-cystic fibrosis bronchiectasis diagnosed by high-resolution CT;\n Are sensitive to amikacin;\nAcute exacerbation of bronchiectasis;\nCapable of the completion of bronchoscopy, [OR] alveolar lavage, [OR] pulmonary function testing etc;\nWilling to join in and sign the informed consent form.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nActive bleeding [NOT] without control;\nReceiving nasal [OR] or facial surgery recently;\nWith severe cardio-pulmonary dysfunction, such as left heart failure, unstable arrhythmia, etc.\nWith other respiratory diseases: such as active pulmonary tuberculosis, [OR] non-tuberculosis mycobacteria (NTM) pulmonary disease, [OR] pulmonary aspergillosis, etc.\nBe allergic to amikacin<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Age=18 years [AND] and =80 years;
Patients with [NOT] non-cystic fibrosis bronchiectasis diagnosed by high-resolution CT;
 Are sensitive to amikacin;
Acute exacerbation of bronchiectasis;
Capable of the completion of bronchoscopy, [OR] alveolar lavage, [OR] pulmonary function testing etc;
Willing to join in and sign the informed consent form.

Exclusion Criteria:
Active bleeding [NOT] without control;
Receiving nasal [OR] or facial surgery recently;
With severe cardio-pulmonary dysfunction, such as left heart failure, unstable arrhythmia, etc.
With other respiratory diseases: such as active pulmonary tuberculosis, [OR] non-tuberculosis mycobacteria (NTM) pulmonary disease, [OR] pulmonary aspergillosis, etc.
Be allergic to amikacin
