ase (GAD);\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nType 1 diabetes mellitus,presence of autoimmune diabetes indicated by antibodies to insulin, [OR] islet cells, [OR] and GAD;\nGestational diabetes;\npatients with heart, [OR] liver, [OR] or renal function impairment;presence of severe infections [OR] or cerebrovascular disease;<|eot_id|>']
