Newly dignosised type 2 diabetes according to WHO criteria.glycated hemoglobin (HbA1c) was more than 10%;
Seronegative for antibodies against insulin, [OR] islet cells [OR] and glutamic acid decarboxylase (GAD);

Exclusion Criteria:
Type 1 diabetes mellitus,presence of autoimmune diabetes indicated by antibodies to insulin, [OR] islet cells, [OR] and GAD;
