by metabolic factors (hypoglycemia, [OR] hypocalcemia, [OR] electrolyte disorder)\nBabies [AND] who have received phenobarbitone [OR] or any other anticonvulsive medication before hospitalization\nAbnormal renal function<|eot_id|>']
