ction [AND] and anastomosis, with or without preoperative chemo-radiotherapy.\nAdenocarcinoma of low [OR] or moderate differentiation\nASA I, II, III.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nDo not sign informed consent\nPregnant patients\nLiver cirrhosis\n Undifferentiated adenocarcinoma.\ncT4\nMetastatic disease (M1)\nchronic renal failure on dialysis\nASA IV\nBMI <18 [OR] and> 35 kg / m2<|eot_id|>']
