cute liver failure\nDementia\nHigh-grade block in the [NOT] absence of a functioning pacemaker.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Septic shock patients despite early goal directed therapy
Agree to participate this study

Exclusion Criteria:
Age< 18
Pregnancy
Bradycardia (HR<55bpm)
Systolic Blood Pressure < 80 mmHg [OR] / Mean arterial pressure < 50 mmHg on maximal support
Death imminent
Unlikely to survive 90 days
Acute liver failure
Dementia
High-grade block in the [NOT] absence of a functioning pacemaker.
