Patients undergoing colon resection

Exclusion Criteria:
Emergency surgery needed
Bowel obstruction
Colonoscopy scheduled to be undertaken peroperatively
Other reason indicating mechanical preparation [OR] or contradicting it
Allergy to used drugs (PEG, [OR] neomycin, [OR] metronidazole)
