dol, [OR] artane, [OR] Phenergan (Promethazine), [OR] chlorpromazine, [OR] erythromycin, [OR] Azithromycin, [OR] clarithromycin, [OR] Ketoconazole, [OR] fluconazole, [OR] mefloquine (as prophylaxis), [OR] lumefantrine (in Coartem), [OR] quinine, [OR] Septrin\nanyone seriously ill\ncurrently taking antimalarial medicines\n allergy to artemisinin drugs\npregnant women [AND] in first trimester\nchildren under 3 months of age\nreported heart condition<|eot_id|>']
