Blood disorders [OR] or coagulopathy.
Diagnosed [OR] or suspected local gynecologic lesion (polyp, [OR] adenomyosis, [OR] myoma, [OR] malignancy [OR] or cervical pathology).
Use intrauterine contraceptive device.
Pregnancy related conditions.
