e largest diameter in any plane on MR images)\nASA (American Society of Anesthesiologist) status 1-3 (27)\nWritten informed consent from participating patients\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nAge younger than 18 yrs. [OR] or older than 75 yrs.\nPregnancy [OR] or nursing (negative pregnancy blood test)\nHistory of allergic reactions to phenylephrine [OR] or ephedrine\neGFR < 60ml/min/1.73 m2<|eot_id|>']
