c agent, twice random glucose measurements major than 200 mg/dl, [OR] or a fasting glucose major than 140 mg/dl)\nUlcer located on the legs [OR] or feet, stage III or IV (Wagner Classification System)\nThe subject agrees to comply with study protocol requirements and all follow up visit requirements.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nUncontrolled diabetes\nUlcer infection\n [NOT] Non-diabetic ulcers Orthopedic [OR] or neuromuscular pathologic conditions<|eot_id|>']
