s between 16(0) and 36(6) weeks\nCerclage in situ\nPainful regular uterine contraction [OR] and/or preterm labor\nRuptured membranes\nMajor fetal defects\nActive vaginal bleeding\nPlacenda previa [OR] and/or accreta\nCervical dilation >1.5 cm [OR] and/or visible membranes by pelvic exam\nSuspicion of chorioamnionitis<|eot_id|>']
