nflammation over a period of at least 1 month before the study.\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nControl: devoid of any systemic [OR] or neurological diseases\nChronic migraine: by ICHD-III (International Classification of Headache Disorder) criteria\nFibromyalgia: by ACR (American College of Rheumatology) 2010 criteria\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nhistory of major systemic illness, including uncontrolled hypertension, [OR] diabetes, [OR] chronic renal insufficiency, [OR] autoimmune diseases [OR] or malignancies\nhistory of neurological disorders which might affect sensation such as previous stroke [OR] or peripheral neuropathy\nhistory of substance abuse (except painkillers)\nheavy smokers (with a daily consumption >20 cigarettes)\npregnancy [OR] or lactation\nany contraindication for magnetic resonance imaging (MRI)\nand any obvious infection [OR] or inflammation over a period of at least 1 month before the study.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Control: devoid of any systemic [OR] or neurological diseases
Chronic migraine: by ICHD-III (International Classification of Headache Disorder) criteria
Fibromyalgia: by ACR (American College of Rheumatology) 2010 criteria

Exclusion Criteria:
history of major systemic illness, including uncontrolled hypertension, [OR] diabetes, [OR] chronic renal insufficiency, [OR] autoimmune diseases [OR] or malignancies
history of neurological disorders which might affect sensation such as previous stroke [OR] or peripheral neuropathy
history of substance abuse (except painkillers)
heavy smokers (with a daily consumption >20 cigarettes)
pregnancy [OR] or lactation
any contraindication for magnetic resonance imaging (MRI)
and any obvious infection [OR] or inflammation over a period of at least 1 month before the study.
