ormal karyotype \nPrevious pelvic [OR] or abdominal radiotherapy \nPrevious surgical management of ovarian pathology \nChronic disease: renal, [OR] liver, [OR] cardiac, [OR] malignancy       <|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Women [AND] with POI: For the purpose of the research women is considered to have POI if she is aged less than 40 years [AND] and has amenorrhea  of at least 4 month [AND] with FSH level above 25 IU/L (repeated twice >4 weeks apart). 

Exclusion Criteria:
Abnormal karyotype 
Previous pelvic [OR] or abdominal radiotherapy 
Previous surgical management of ovarian pathology 
Chronic disease: renal, [OR] liver, [OR] cardiac, [OR] malignancy       
