Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nConfirmed diagnosis (clinical and histological features) of Hailey Hailey or Darier diseases. \nModerate to very severe lesions located in large folds \nPatient aged 18 ans or more \nPatient with health coverage \nPatient who have signed the consent form \nPatient proficient into filling out the questionnaires. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHypersensibility to toxin or excipients \nMyastheny \nDeglutition\'s problems \nPast medical history of dysphagia or aspiration pneumonia \nPregnancy (positive B-HCG test performed a maxima 72h before) or breastfeeding \nMental, physical incapacity to fill in the questionnaires \nGuardianship patients \nSkin infections at the inclusion visit \nApplication in the last 7 days at the site of injection of local treatments (apart emollients or antiseptics) or injections of botulism toxin or dynamic phototherapy or laser in the last 6 months. \nSystemic treatment with aminosides in the last 15 days \nInclusion in another study in the last 2 months.       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nConfirmed diagnosis (clinical [OR] and histological features) of Hailey Hailey [OR] or Darier diseases. \nModerate to very severe lesions located in large folds \nPatient aged 18 ans or more \nPatient with health coverage \nPatient who have signed the consent form \nPatient proficient into filling out the questionnaires. \n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHypersensibility to toxin [OR] or excipients \n Myastheny \nDeglutition\'s problems \nPast medical history of dysphagia [OR] or aspiration pneumonia \nPregnancy (positive B-HCG test performed a maxima 72h before) [OR] or breastfeeding \nMental, physical incapacity to fill in the questionnaires \nGuardianship patients \nSkin infections at the inclusion visit \nApplication in the last 7 days at the site of injection of local treatments (apart emollients [OR] or antiseptics) [OR] or injections of botulism toxin [OR] or dynamic phototherapy [OR] or laser in the last 6 months. \nSystemic treatment with aminosides in the last 15 days \nInclusion in another study in the last 2 months.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Confirmed diagnosis (clinical [OR] and histological features) of Hailey Hailey [OR] or Darier diseases. 
Moderate to very severe lesions located in large folds 
Patient aged 18 ans or more 
Patient with health coverage 
Patient who have signed the consent form 
Patient proficient into filling out the questionnaires. 

Exclusion Criteria:
Hypersensibility to toxin [OR] or excipients 
 Myastheny 
Deglutition's problems 
Past medical history of dysphagia [OR] or aspiration pneumonia 
Pregnancy (positive B-HCG test performed a maxima 72h before) [OR] or breastfeeding 
Mental, physical incapacity to fill in the questionnaires 
Guardianship patients 
Skin infections at the inclusion visit 
Application in the last 7 days at the site of injection of local treatments (apart emollients [OR] or antiseptics) [OR] or injections of botulism toxin [OR] or dynamic phototherapy [OR] or laser in the last 6 months. 
Systemic treatment with aminosides in the last 15 days 
Inclusion in another study in the last 2 months.
