tis (abdominal computed tomography scan)\n [NOT] No antibiotic treatment in the last 2 weeks\nImmunocompetence*\n [NOT] No significant comorbidities**\n Good oral tolerance\n Good symptom control\nMaximum one of the following SIRS criteria (* T>38 ºC [OR] or <36ºC, L>12,000 [OR] or <4000/uL, HR>90 bpm, [OR] RR<20 rpm) [OR] or CRP>15 mg/dL\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nNA<|eot_id|>']
