Maximum one of the following SIRS criteria (* T>38 ºC [OR] or <36ºC, L>12,000 [OR] or <4000/uL, HR>90 bpm, [OR] RR<20 rpm) [OR] or CRP>15 mg/dL

Exclusion Criteria:
NA
