iteria:\nAcute coronary syndrome within 1 month\nHeart failure NYHA III to IV\nContraindication to Aspirin\nOn anticoagulant therapy\nEmergent surgery\nCardiac surgery\nHigh bleeding risk surgeries, e.g., Intra-cranial surgery, [OR] Intra-spinal surgery, [OR] Retinal surgery\nPregnancy [OR] or breast-feeding\nLife expectancy less than 1year<|eot_id|>']
