ory of loose [OR] or watery stools\nPatient has both clinically significant findings [AND] and unexplained clinically significant alarm symptoms\nPatient has symptoms of [OR] or been diagnosed with a medical condition that may contribute to abdominal pain\nPatient has any protocol-excluded [OR] or clinically significant medical [OR] or surgical history that could confound the study assessments<|eot_id|>']
