s as determined by the skin test\nDiagnosis or h/o PTSD, depression, substance use, mental health problems, sleep disorders, HPA disruption and/or TBI\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nBody Mass Index (BMI) = 35 kg/m2\nHbA1c = 5.7%\nAbility to speak and understand English\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nRheumatoid arthritis\nDiabetes [OR] or immediate family history of diabetes\nCoronary artery disease\nCongestive heart failure\nPulmonary disorders, including COPD [OR] and asthma\nMalabsorptive GI disease, such as celiac disease, [OR] or gastric bypass\nSignificant hepatic disease\nRenal insufficiency (eGFR < 60 mL/kg/min)\nAnemia (hematocrit < 34%) as measured at screening visit\nPregnant females\nConsumption of daily medications that alter glucose metabolism [OR] of GI function (glucocorticoids, [OR] psychotropics, [OR] narcotics, [OR] metoclopramide)\nConsumption [OR] or injection of insulin\nApparent sensitivity to any of the study peptides as determined by the skin test\nDiagnosis [OR] or h/o PTSD, [OR] depression, [OR] substance use, [OR] mental health problems, [OR] sleep disorders, [OR] HPA disruption [OR] and/or TBI<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Body Mass Index (BMI) = 35 kg/m2
HbA1c = 5.7%
Ability to speak and understand English

Exclusion Criteria:
Rheumatoid arthritis
Diabetes [OR] or immediate family history of diabetes
Coronary artery disease
Congestive heart failure
Pulmonary disorders, including COPD [OR] and asthma
Malabsorptive GI disease, such as celiac disease, [OR] or gastric bypass
Significant hepatic disease
Renal insufficiency (eGFR < 60 mL/kg/min)
Anemia (hematocrit < 34%) as measured at screening visit
Pregnant females
Consumption of daily medications that alter glucose metabolism [OR] of GI function (glucocorticoids, [OR] psychotropics, [OR] narcotics, [OR] metoclopramide)
Consumption [OR] or injection of insulin
Apparent sensitivity to any of the study peptides as determined by the skin test
Diagnosis [OR] or h/o PTSD, [OR] depression, [OR] substance use, [OR] mental health problems, [OR] sleep disorders, [OR] HPA disruption [OR] and/or TBI
