ter pretreatment.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nwith centre neural system involvement\nserious complications such as uncontrolled diabetes, [OR] gastric ulcer [OR] or other serious angiocardiopathy determined by the physician\nHIV positive [OR] or active HBV infection [OR] or other uncontrolled systematic infection\nclinical central nervous dysfunction\nserious surgery within 30 days\npregnancy [OR] or baby nursing period [OR] or un-contracepted child bearing period woman.<|eot_id|>']
