e to very severe COPD (FEV1 <80% predicted), according to the GesEPOC criteria, established at least 3 months\ncurrent [OR] or former smoker [AND] with an accumulated consumption >10 packs x year\nhospital admission for COPD exacerbation\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nosteoarticular, [OR] neuromuscular [OR] or cognitive limitation that [NOT] prevents ambulation\nprevious diagnosis of active neoplastic disease\ninstitutionalized patients; alcohol consumption >60 g/day\npatient belonging to another health sector in the Community of Madrid [OR] or other community\nparticipation in another study within 6 months prior.<|eot_id|>']
