yocardial infarction, [OR] stroke, [OR] repeat revascularization, [OR] or major bleeding\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nContraindication to antiplatelet therapy\nNeed to continue clopidogrel due to stroke, [OR] peripheral disease, significant carotid disease [OR] or recent acute coronary syndrome\nMajor bleeding [OR] history [OR] or bleeding diathesis\nPregnancy<|eot_id|>']
