bove the age of 18\nPatients undergoing laparoscopic [OR] or robotic colorectal resections\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHistory of constipation\nPre-existing use of narcotics [OR] or opioids\n Pre-existing renal [OR] or hepatic failure\nMental illness, [OR] mental retardation, [OR] or [NOT] inability to participate in informed consent due to mental status\nPre-existing dementia\nAllergy to any protocol medication\nEmergency operation\nSubjects who are incarcerated [OR] or wards of the state\nMinors\nSubjects with inflammatory bowel disease, active colitis, [OR] or pre-existing intra-abdominal inflammation. Diverticulitis [NOT] without active infection/ [OR] inflammation will [NOT] not be [NOT] excluded.<|eot_id|>']
