ition for Acute Bacterial Skin and Skin Structure Infections (ABSSSI)\nKnown or suspected gram-positive infection.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nKnown or suspected gram-negative infections, [OR] anaerobic infections, [OR] or fungemia\nKnown or suspected infections that are severe, [OR] life threatening [OR] or are [NOT] not included in the ABSSSI Food and Drug Administration (FDA) guidance\nInjection drug users [AND] with a fever\nSevere neurological disorder leading to immobility [OR] or confined to a wheelchair\nBilateral Lower extremity involvement of the suspected infection.<|eot_id|>']
