n; cardiovascular disease, uncontrolled chronic HT (hypertension),DM (diabetes mellitus), History of gynecologic surgery, female gynecological cancer ( breast, [OR] ovarian, [OR] uterine, [OR] cervical)\nMedications associated with female sexual dysfunction; Antidepressants [OR] opiates, [OR] beta blockers, [OR] Antiepileptics [OR] ( gabapentin, [OR] topiramate, [OR] phenytoin) benzodiazepines<|eot_id|>']
