on Criteria:\nno consent\nperiprocedural complications requiring continuation of heparin [OR] or administration of protamine sulfate\nalergy to fish, [OR] protamine, [OR] protamine derivates, history of Humulin N, [OR] Novolin N, [OR] Novolin NPH, [OR] Gensulin N, [OR] SciLin N, [OR] NPH Iletin II [OR] and isophane insulin intake<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
patients who underwent successful TAVI
with any approved TAVI device
via transfemoral access
with use of any of the approved vascular closure devices
provided written informed consent

