Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nAge equal or superior to 18 years;\nBoth genders;\nLucid and without diagnosis of any psychiatric disorder;\nDiagnosed with head and neck cancer and treated for a period of up to 5 years with radiotherapy where the major salivary glands (parotid, submandibular and sublingual) were included in the radiation field;\nPrimary Sjögren\'s syndrome with the diagnosis made by the American-European criteria.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nSensitivity to pilocarpine\nSecondary Sjögren\'s syndrome;\nType II diabetes mellitus;\nAIDS;\npregnant or lactating women;\nGlaucoma;\nUncontrolled asthma;\nChronic obstructive pulmonary disease;\nRenal diseases;\nSevere cardiovascular diseases;\nGastrointestinal disorders;\nHepatic insufficiency.\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nAge equal or superior to 18 years;\nBoth genders;\nLucid [AND] and [NOT] without diagnosis of any psychiatric disorder;\nDiagnosed with head [OR] and neck cancer [AND] and treated for a period of up to 5 years with radiotherapy where the major salivary glands (parotid, [OR] submandibular [OR] and sublingual) were included in the radiation field;\nPrimary Sjögren\'s syndrome [AND] with the diagnosis made by the American-European criteria.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nSensitivity to pilocarpine\nSecondary Sjögren\'s syndrome;\n Type II diabetes mellitus;\n AIDS;\npregnant [OR] or lactating women;\n Glaucoma;\n Uncontrolled asthma;\n Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease;\n Renal diseases;\n Severe cardiovascular diseases;\n Gastrointestinal disorders;\n Hepatic insufficiency.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Age equal or superior to 18 years;
Both genders;
Lucid [AND] and [NOT] without diagnosis of any psychiatric disorder;
Diagnosed with head [OR] and neck cancer [AND] and treated for a period of up to 5 years with radiotherapy where the major salivary glands (parotid, [OR] submandibular [OR] and sublingual) were included in the radiation field;
Primary Sjögren's syndrome [AND] with the diagnosis made by the American-European criteria.

Exclusion Criteria:
Sensitivity to pilocarpine
Secondary Sjögren's syndrome;
 Type II diabetes mellitus;
 AIDS;
pregnant [OR] or lactating women;
 Glaucoma;
 Uncontrolled asthma;
 Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease;
 Renal diseases;
 Severe cardiovascular diseases;
 Gastrointestinal disorders;
 Hepatic insufficiency.
