<48 hours\nBlind patients\nPatients with a seizure history\nPatients with uncontrolled hypertension\n Patients with a supratheraputic (>3.0) INR\nPatients on strong CYP1A2 inhibitors: ciprofloxacin, [OR] fluvoxamine, [OR] methoxsalen, [OR] ofloxacin, [OR] primaquine\nPatients who do [NOT] not speak English [OR] or Spanish<|eot_id|>']
