Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nPatients older than 18 years\nIschemic symptoms or evidence of myocardial ischemia (inducible or spontaneous) in the presence of >50% de novo stenosis located in native coronary vessels\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nTarget lesion located in the left main stem\nSTEMI\nRestenosis\nCardiogenic shock\nMalignancies or other comorbid conditions with life expectancy less than 12 months or that may result in protocol noncompliance\nKnown allergy to the study medications (probucol, sirolimus, zotarolimus)\nPregnancy (present, suspected, or planned)\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nPatients older than 18 years\nIschemic symptoms [OR] or evidence of myocardial ischemia (inducible [OR] or spontaneous) in the presence of >50% de novo stenosis located in native coronary vessels\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nTarget lesion located in the left main stem\nSTEMI\nRestenosis\nCardiogenic shock\nMalignancies [OR] or other comorbid conditions [AND] with life expectancy less than 12 months [OR] or that may result in protocol [NOT] noncompliance\nKnown allergy to the study medications (probucol, [OR] sirolimus, [OR] zotarolimus)\nPregnancy (present, [OR] suspected, [OR] or planned)<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Patients older than 18 years
Ischemic symptoms [OR] or evidence of myocardial ischemia (inducible [OR] or spontaneous) in the presence of >50% de novo stenosis located in native coronary vessels

Exclusion Criteria:
Target lesion located in the left main stem
STEMI
Restenosis
Cardiogenic shock
Malignancies [OR] or other comorbid conditions [AND] with life expectancy less than 12 months [OR] or that may result in protocol [NOT] noncompliance
Known allergy to the study medications (probucol, [OR] sirolimus, [OR] zotarolimus)
Pregnancy (present, [OR] suspected, [OR] or planned)
