ia:\nsevere coronary artery disease, [OR] heart failure, [OR] kidney failure\ninsulin-dependent DM (diabetes mellitus), poorly controlled type II DM\ngastric/ [OR] duodenal ulcer\nallergy/ [OR] contra-indication for any drug used in the study\ncorticosteroid use during last 3 months\npreoperative use of opioid drugs (excl. codeine, [OR] tramadol)\nneuropathy/ [OR] sensory impairment of lower limbs\nlack of co-operation, e.g. [NOT] inability to use a PCA (patient controlled analgesia)-device<|eot_id|>']
