Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\n18 - 64 years old\nAble to give consent\nunprotected sex (in past 6 months) with 1 or more men of unknown HIV status\nevaluated for an STI within 6 months prior to screening\nsex in last 6 months with an HIV-infected partner\nIDU with report of using previously used or shared needles in past 6 months or has been in a methadone, buprenorphine, or suboxone treatment program in past 6 months or engaging in high-risk sexual behaviors\nindividuals engaging in transactional sex (i.e sex for money, drugs, or housing)\nInfrequently uses condoms during sex with 1 or more partners of unknown HIV status who are known to be at substantial risk of HIV infection (IDU or bisexual male partner)\nCrCl = 60 ml/min\nHIV- uninfected women desiring PrEP\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nActive alcohol or drug use or dependence which may interfere with adherence to study requirements\nHIV-infected at screening or enrollment\nEstimated CrCl < 60 mL/min\nPast participation in an HIV vaccine study\nPositive Hepatitis B surface antigen test\nUnderlying medical condition with survival unlikely during follow-up period\nAny condition that in the opinion of study staff would make participation in the study unsafe or interfere with achieving study objectives\nPregnant or breast feeding\nActively trying to achieve pregnancy\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n18 - 64 years old\nAble to give consent\nunprotected sex (in past 6 months) [AND] with 1 or more men [AND] of unknown HIV status\nevaluated for an STI within 6 months prior to screening\nsex in last 6 months [AND] with an HIV-infected partner\nIDU [AND] with report of using previously used [OR] or shared needles in past 6 months [OR] or has been in a methadone, [OR] buprenorphine, [OR] or suboxone treatment program in past 6 months [OR] or engaging in high-risk sexual behaviors\nindividuals engaging in transactional sex (i.e sex for money, [OR] drugs, [OR] or housing)\nInfrequently uses condoms during sex [AND] with 1 or more partners [AND] of unknown HIV status [AND] who are known to be at substantial risk of HIV infection (IDU [OR] or bisexual male partner)\nCrCl = 60 ml/min\nHIV- [NOT] uninfected women desiring PrEP\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nActive alcohol [OR] or drug use [OR] or dependence which may interfere with adherence to study requirements\nHIV-infected at screening [OR] or enrollment\nEstimated CrCl < 60 mL/min\nPast participation in an HIV vaccine study\nPositive Hepatitis B surface antigen test\nUnderlying medical condition [AND] with survival unlikely during follow-up period\nAny condition that in the opinion of study staff would make participation in the study unsafe [OR] or interfere with achieving study objectives\nPregnant [OR] or breast feeding\nActively trying to achieve pregnancy<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
18 - 64 years old
Able to give consent
unprotected sex (in past 6 months) [AND] with 1 or more men [AND] of unknown HIV status
evaluated for an STI within 6 months prior to screening
sex in last 6 months [AND] with an HIV-infected partner
IDU [AND] with report of using previously used [OR] or shared needles in past 6 months [OR] or has been in a methadone, [OR] buprenorphine, [OR] or suboxone treatment program in past 6 months [OR] or engaging in high-risk sexual behaviors
individuals engaging in transactional sex (i.e sex for money, [OR] drugs, [OR] or housing)
Infrequently uses condoms during sex [AND] with 1 or more partners [AND] of unknown HIV status [AND] who are known to be at substantial risk of HIV infection (IDU [OR] or bisexual male partner)
CrCl = 60 ml/min
HIV- [NOT] uninfected women desiring PrEP

Exclusion Criteria:
Active alcohol [OR] or drug use [OR] or dependence which may interfere with adherence to study requirements
HIV-infected at screening [OR] or enrollment
Estimated CrCl < 60 mL/min
Past participation in an HIV vaccine study
Positive Hepatitis B surface antigen test
Underlying medical condition [AND] with survival unlikely during follow-up period
Any condition that in the opinion of study staff would make participation in the study unsafe [OR] or interfere with achieving study objectives
Pregnant [OR] or breast feeding
Actively trying to achieve pregnancy
