onal age at time of dilator insertion\nAble to read and write in English\nActive cell phone with text messaging capability\nRide home from dilator insertion clinic appointment\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nCurrent use of gabapentin [OR] or pregabalin\nAllergy to gabapentin, [OR] acetaminophen, [OR] codeine, [OR] or ibuprofen\nSelf reported renal disease (severe impaired renal function)\n Self reported current [OR] or chronic narcotic use (typical daily use)\nWomen [AND] with any issue that, in the opinion of the investigator, would interfere with study participation or generating accurate study data<|eot_id|>']
