e under the age of 18 (or if 18 years old and older consent for themselves)\nAvailable at school for at least the first pharyngeal swab [AND] and willing to comply with study procedures\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPrevious anaphylaxis following any component of Bexsero vaccine\nPrevious receipt of meningococcal B vaccine (Bexsero)\nKnown pregnancy<|eot_id|>']
