t 250 microns\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nHistory of anti-vascular endothelial growth factor treatment in the past 12 months\nAny diabetic macular edema treatment in the past 4 months\nHeart attack, [OR] stroke, [OR] transient ischemic attack [OR] or acute congestive heart failure within 4 months<|eot_id|>']
