\nLiver dysfunction [AND] and elevated Liver Function Tests (LFTs)\nAlcohol [OR] or drug dependency\nMental retardation\nLess than 50 kg of weight\nregnant women\nPatients requiring long-acting opioid pain management (including fentanyl patch, [OR] oxycontin, etc) for over 3 weeks immediately prior to surgery<|eot_id|>']
