rovides informed consent\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nSubjects with a history of hypercoagulopathy, [OR] deep vein thrombosis (DVT), [OR] pulmonary embolism\nRenal impairment\n Subjects with known hypersensitivity to tranexamic acid\nConsecutive fibrinolytic states to coagulopathy\nHistory of convulsions<|eot_id|>']
