File: NCT03117608 

Das File: /work/eauten2s/ec_criteria_struct/chia/input/chia_text_full/NCT03117608.txt wurde erfolgreich geladen.
Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nPatients provided written informed consent;\nPatients aged between 18 and 75 years;\nKnee symptomatic OA (Kellgren-Lawrence grade 1-4)\nFailure of conservative treatment for at least 3 months;\nPatients agreed to actively participate in the rehabilitation protocol and follow-up program;\nMale or female patients;\nWomen of childbearing age had to use a proven method to prevent pregnancy, before the surgical treatment.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPatients incapable to understanding and will;\nPatients participating in previous, concurrent or not, trials (ongoing or completed within three months);\nPatients surgically treated for the same defect within one year;\nPatients affected by malignancy;\nPatients affected by metabolic or thyroid disorders;\nPatients used to alcohol or drug (medication) abuse;\nPatients affected by synovitis;\nVarus or valgus misalignment exceeding 15°;\nBody Mass Index > 40;\nPatients with trauma within 6 months pre-operative.\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nPatients provided written informed consent;\nPatients aged between 18 and 75 years;\nKnee symptomatic OA (Kellgren-Lawrence grade 1-4)\nFailure of conservative treatment for at least 3 months;\nPatients agreed to actively participate in the rehabilitation protocol and follow-up program;\nMale [OR] or female patients;\nWomen [AND] of childbearing age had to use a proven method to [NOT] prevent pregnancy, before the surgical treatment.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nPatients incapable to understanding and will;\nPatients participating in previous, [OR] concurrent [OR] or [NOT] not, trials (ongoing [OR] or completed within three months);\nPatients surgically treated for the same defect within one year;\nPatients affected by malignancy;\n Patients affected by metabolic [OR] or thyroid disorders;\n Patients used to alcohol [OR] or drug (medication) abuse;\n Patients affected by synovitis;\nVarus [OR] or valgus misalignment exceeding 15°;\nBody Mass Index > 40;\nPatients with trauma within 6 months pre-operative.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Patients provided written informed consent;
Patients aged between 18 and 75 years;
Knee symptomatic OA (Kellgren-Lawrence grade 1-4)
Failure of conservative treatment for at least 3 months;
Patients agreed to actively participate in the rehabilitation protocol and follow-up program;
Male [OR] or female patients;
Women [AND] of childbearing age had to use a proven method to [NOT] prevent pregnancy, before the surgical treatment.

Exclusion Criteria:
Patients incapable to understanding and will;
Patients participating in previous, [OR] concurrent [OR] or [NOT] not, trials (ongoing [OR] or completed within three months);
Patients surgically treated for the same defect within one year;
Patients affected by malignancy;
 Patients affected by metabolic [OR] or thyroid disorders;
 Patients used to alcohol [OR] or drug (medication) abuse;
 Patients affected by synovitis;
Varus [OR] or valgus misalignment exceeding 15°;
Body Mass Index > 40;
Patients with trauma within 6 months pre-operative.
