Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nInclusion Criteria:\nWomen (18-75 years) with suspected UTI\nat least two symptoms of UTI (dysuria, urgency of micturition, frequency, lower abdominal pain)\nWritten informed consent\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nsigns of complicated UTI (e. g. temperature > 38°C, loin tenderness)\nconditions that may lead to complicated infections (i.e. renal diseases, patients with urinary catheter)\npregnancy/ breastfeeding\ncurrent self-medication with UU preparations e.g. z.B. Cystinol®, Uvalysat®, Arctuvan®\nantibiotic use in the last 7 days\nprevious UTI in the past 2 weeks\nhistory of pyelonephritis\ncontraindications for trial drugs\nserious diseases\ninability to understand trial Information\ncurrent participation in another clinical trial or participation in another clinical trial within the last 4 weeks\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nWomen (18-75 years) [AND] with suspected UTI\nat least two symptoms of UTI (dysuria, [OR] urgency of micturition, [OR] frequency, [OR] lower abdominal pain)\nWritten informed consent\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nsigns of complicated UTI (e. g. temperature > 38°C, [OR] loin tenderness)\nconditions that may lead to complicated infections (i.e. renal diseases, [OR] patients with urinary catheter)\npregnancy/ [OR] breastfeeding\ncurrent self-medication with UU preparations e.g. z.B. Cystinol®, [OR] Uvalysat®, [OR] Arctuvan®\nantibiotic use in the last 7 days\nprevious UTI in the past 2 weeks\nhistory of pyelonephritis\ncontraindications for trial drugs\nserious diseases\ninability to understand trial information\ncurrent participation in another clinical trial or participation in another clinical trial within the last 4 weeks<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Women (18-75 years) [AND] with suspected UTI
at least two symptoms of UTI (dysuria, [OR] urgency of micturition, [OR] frequency, [OR] lower abdominal pain)
Written informed consent

Exclusion Criteria:
signs of complicated UTI (e. g. temperature > 38°C, [OR] loin tenderness)
conditions that may lead to complicated infections (i.e. renal diseases, [OR] patients with urinary catheter)
pregnancy/ [OR] breastfeeding
current self-medication with UU preparations e.g. z.B. Cystinol®, [OR] Uvalysat®, [OR] Arctuvan®
antibiotic use in the last 7 days
previous UTI in the past 2 weeks
history of pyelonephritis
contraindications for trial drugs
serious diseases
inability to understand trial information
current participation in another clinical trial or participation in another clinical trial within the last 4 weeks
