moxicillin, [OR] metronidazole, [OR] clarithromycin, [OR] tetracycline) [OR] and PPI (esomeprazole),\ncontraindication to treatment drugs,\npregnant [OR] or lactating women,\nsevere concurrent disease,\nconcomitant use of clopidogrel, or (9) Unwilling to accept random assignment of subjects\n\nExclusion Criteria:\nNA<|eot_id|>']
